"description":"Welcome to Mamba Snake – a modern, adrenaline-fueled twist on the classic territory-capture arcade genre!\n\nYour mission is simple yet dangerous: Conquer the map by enclosing areas while dodging the deadly Mamba Snake and its cunning spider minions. Draw your lines carefully, enclose the grid, and claim your territory to advance to the next level. But beware – if an enemy touches your trail before you close the loop, it's game over!\n\nFeatures:\n- Intense Strategy: Plan your moves instantly. Risk it all to capture huge areas for bonus points, or play it safe with small zones to survive.\n- Dynamic AI Enemies: Face off against a smart, unpredictable Mamba Snake that hunts you down and adapts to your movements.\n- Stunning Visuals: Enjoy vibrant graphics, smooth animations, and immersive effects as you fill the board.\n- Endless Challenge: Hundreds of levels with increasing difficulty. Faster enemies and tighter spaces await you!\n- Intuitive Controls: Designed perfectly for mobile play—just swipe to move and conquer.\n\nTest your reflexes and strategy in this addictive arcade challenge. Can you conquer the map without getting bitten? Download Mamba Snake now and start your adventure!", "minimumOsVersion":"17.6", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"25445376", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":0, "trackContentRating":"4+", "trackCensoredName":"Mamba Snake", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/mamba-snake/id6757639534?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "averageUserRating":0, "releaseDate":"2026-01-12T08:00:00Z", "userRatingCount":0}]
